@startuml screenflow-posting
' Spec 003 — screen flow. Each state is a screen (key elements listed); each arrow is a user action.
' Every user story US-003-1..12 is a path through this diagram (see table in spec.md).

hide empty description
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor white
  BackgroundColor<<public>> #f8fafc
  BorderColor #94a3b8
  FontSize 12
}
skinparam arrowFontSize 11

title Spec 003 — screen flow (375 px, Employer; Admin enters from the Admin area)

state "Drawer (☰)" as Drawer <<public>>
Drawer : Employer: Browse · My listings ·
Drawer : [ + Post a job ] · Settings · Log out

state "Admin area (spec 002)" as AdminArea <<public>>
AdminArea : Regions · My listings · Post a job

state "My listings" as Mine
Mine : [ + Post a job ]
Mine : "2 of 3 open listings used"
Mine : Barista · Davao City · ₱14,000–16,000/mo   Live
Mine : Cashier · Cebu · ₱12,000–13,000/mo   Waiting for approval
Mine : Line cook · Davao City · ₱15,000–18,000/mo   Needs changes
Mine : Dishwasher · Not finished yet   Draft
Mine : Server · Davao City · ₱13,000–14,000/mo   Closed

state "Business details" as Business
Business : Business name ___________
Business : About the business (optional) ___
Business : "Shown on every listing you post."
Business : [ Save ]

state "Listing form (new / edit)" as Form
Form : Job title ___________
Form : Region [ Davao City ▾ ]   Area ______
Form : Salary per month ₱ ____ to ₱ ____
Form : Type [ Full-time ▾ ]   Schedule ______
Form : About the job / Requirements / Benefits
Form : [ Save draft ]   Cancel

state "Listing (owner view)" as Listing
Listing : status + what happens next
Listing : the listing as visitors will see it
Listing : Draft: [ Submit for approval ] Edit · Delete
Listing : Waiting for approval: Withdraw
Listing : Needs changes: reason, Edit, [ Resubmit ] · Delete
Listing : Live: Close listing
Listing : Closed / Taken down: no actions

[*] --> Drawer : logged in as Employer
[*] --> AdminArea : logged in as Admin
AdminArea --> Mine : My listings
AdminArea --> Form : Post a job\n(business details saved)
AdminArea --> Business : Post a job\n(no business details yet)
Drawer --> Mine : My listings
Drawer --> Form : Post a job\n(business details saved)
Drawer --> Business : Post a job\n(no business details yet)
Mine --> Form : Post a job
Business --> Form : save\n(first time)
Business --> Mine : save\n(from "Edit business details")
Mine --> Business : Edit business details
Form --> Listing : save draft
Form --> Form : validation error
Mine --> Listing : tap a row
Listing --> Form : Edit\n(Draft / Needs changes)
Listing --> Listing : Submit / Resubmit → Waiting for approval\n(not complete or limit reached → message)\nWithdraw → Draft\nClose (confirm) → Closed
Listing --> Mine : Delete (confirm)\n(Draft / Needs changes)
Listing --> Mine : back

legend right
  |= Shade |= Meaning |
  | light grey | shared navigation |
endlegend
@enduml
